# Generated files that ripgrep-based search (rg, coding agents' search tools) skips by default. They stay in git;
# this only keeps them out of search results: a component manifest is one JSON line of up to 2 MB, so a single hit in
# one floods a result. Read them directly, or through the c2n MCP server (`get_component`), when they are what you need.
# `rg --no-ignore-dot` searches them too.

# Component manifests (vite-plugin-cem, one line each) and what is merged or built from them
**/custom-elements.json
packages/tools/mcp/readiness/baseline.json

# The umbrella's generated bundle inputs (@c2n/framework-types)
packages/umbrella/src/

# The generated component catalog of the c2n-components skill (the rest of the skill is hand-written)
packages/tools/skill/skills/c2n-components/references/component-catalog.md

# Changelog generated from git history
CHANGELOG.md
apps/ui/src/data/changelog.json

pnpm-lock.yaml
